    skos:definition 'The hourly vector of the dynamic body acceleration (VeDBA) recorded 23 hours before the timestamp. This is calculated as the sum of VeDBA values over 1-second acceleration bursts, recorded at 28 Hz, one time each minute. Example: \'113984\'; Units: m/s^2; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000518'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000085/4/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000085/4/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000085/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:31'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'deployment local identifier'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'deployment ID'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A unique identifier for the deployment of a tag on animal, provided by the data owner. If the data owner does not provide a Deployment ID, an internal Movebank deployment identifier may sometimes be shown. Example: \'Jane_42818\'; Units: none; Entity described: deployment'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000085'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000477/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000477/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000477/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:31'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'tdr depth'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'depth'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The device depth below the water surface. Example: \'16.4\'; Units: meters; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000477'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000406/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000406/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000406/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'sensor type ID'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Used in the REST API. The ID for the type of sensor with which data were collected. Allowed values are 2365683 = acceleration; 7842954 = accessory-measurements; 1239574236 = acoustic-telemetry; 82798 = argos-doppler-shift; 4342918458 = atlas-geolocation; 77740391 = barometer; 397 = bird-ring; 3090218819 = derived; 3090218812 = geolocation-api; 3090218818 = gnss; 653 = gps; 1297673380 = gyroscope; 2206221896 = heart-rate; 77740402 = magnetometer; 2365682 = natural-mark; 819073350 = orientation; 2645090675 = proximity; 673 = radio-transmitter; 2299894820 = sigfox-geolocation; 3886361 = solar-geolocator; 9301403 = solar-geolocator-raw; 914097241 = solar-geolocator-twilight; 4264744764 = tdr. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000406'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000476/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000476/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000476/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'GSAT orientation'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The orientation of the unit as measured by the accelerometer (definition from Global Satellite Engineeering, 2024). Values indicate the axis that is directed up (away from the horizontal ground surface). Allowed values are XPositive; XNegative; YPositive; YNegative; ZPositive; Znegative. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000476'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000478/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000478/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000478/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'ATLAS varx'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The variance in the easting (X, longitude) estimate in the local UTM zone, calculated by the ATLAS system. Lower values indicate better accuracy. Example: \'3.08617\'; Units: m^2; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000478'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000479/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000479/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000479/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'ATLAS vary'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The variance in the northing (Y, latitude) estimate in the local UTM zone, calculated by the ATLAS system. Lower values indicate better accuracy. Example: \'8.69957\'; Units: m^2; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000479'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000482/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000482/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000482/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'format type'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The data format of the tag used to decode the data. Example: \'TinyFoxStarOddi\'; Units: ; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000482'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000483/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000483/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000483/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sensolus fix type'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The type of Sensolus fix. Possible values include activity, location and status. Example: \'activity\'; Units: none; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000483'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000485/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000485/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000485/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sigfox format character'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The character from the 19th hexadecimal character in the Sigfox payload used to define the format of University of Konstanz Sigfox tags (definition from G. Heine, 2024). Allowed values are 0 = battery voltage 3.2 volts with GPS coordinates; 1 = battery voltage 3.3 volts with GPS coordinates; 2 = battery voltage 3.4 volts with GPS coordinates; 3 = battery voltage 3.5 volts with GPS coordinates; 4 = battery voltage 3.6 volts with GPS coordinates; 5 = battery voltage 3.7 volts with GPS coordinates; 6 = battery voltage 3.8 volts with GPS coordinates; 7 = battery voltage 3.9 volts with GPS coordinates; 8 = sensor data 3 x word; 9 = sensor data 6 x byte; A = alarm message (animal death and coordinates); B = alarm message (animal death and logger status); C = not defined; D = not defined; E = not defined; F = logger status (no GPS) Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000485'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000486/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000486/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000486/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sigfox sensor data raw'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The raw sensor data from the tag encoded in hexadecimal format. Units: none; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000486'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000487/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000487/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000487/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Tinyfox activity percent last 24h'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The percentage of activity (VeDBA above a predetermined threshold) recorded by the tag over the last 24 hours. Units: none (percent); Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000487'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000488/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000488/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000488/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Tinyfox error happened'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Indicates whether the self diagnostic routine of the tag found a problem. TRUE indicates the tag might not work correctly. Allowed values are TRUE or FALSE. Units: none; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000488'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000489/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000489/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000489/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Tinyfox memory full'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Indicates whether the onboard memory of the tag is full and needs to be emptied by an uplink command. Allowed values are TRUE or FALSE. Units: none; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000489'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000490/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000490/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000490/>;
    dc:modified '2024-10-14T10:18:30'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Tinyfox pressure min last 24h'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Minimum air pressure measured by the tag in the past 24 hours. Air pressure is sampled once per minute. Units: mbar (hPa); Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000490'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000491/1/> .
