    skos:prefLabel 'GNSS fix type'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The type of GNSS fix. To import non-numeric characters use \'GNSS fix type raw\'. Allowed values are 1 = no fix; 2 = 2D fix (altitude typically not valid); 3 = 3D fix (altitude typically valid). Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000436'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000437/1/> .
